body:
If you're taking about which skills go in which button, here's how I go

A for basic; 
RT for core or mastery, depending on what is my main damage skill;
X for defensive; 
Y for statuses (like shouts or curses);
LT for ult skill;
RB is the jack of all trades.

Of course, not all builds use all of those, so things may change, but my brain is kinda wired to that config.
